{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude98 Ready to build and grow the car dealership of your dreams?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Dealer Life Simulator</strong> puts you in the driver\u2019s seat of your own auto empire.<br>Start from nothing, buy used cars, inspect, repair, clean, and flip them for profit.<br>Negotiate with customers, take financial risks, expand your dealership, and rise to the top of the car trade world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <i>This game was built entirely by a solo developer, driven by passion and late nights.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfea Start and manage your own car dealership business<br>\ud83d\ude97 Realistic used car system \u2013 mileage, engine condition, tire wear, age, and more<br>\ud83e\uddf0 Add value through repairs, maintenance, and professional cleaning<br>\ud83d\udcac Negotiate with NPC customers and respond to dynamic offers<br>\ud83d\udcb8 Dynamic economy with price trends, seasonal events, and a changing market<br>\ud83c\udfe6 Take loans from banks, manage your interest rates, and keep your cash flowing<br>\ud83d\udcb0 Borrow from the mafia \u2013 fast cash with serious risk<br>\ud83d\udcc9 Avoid bankruptcy through smart decision-making and spending control<br>\ud83c\udfae Level up your character and unlock new trading abilities<br>\ud83c\udf0d Open new branches and expand your reach in the auto trade scene<br><br><br>\ud83d\udca1 <i>Note: Car Dealer Life Simulator is a solo-developed indie game. Every detail, system, and feature is handcrafted. Your support means everything \u2013 thank you for playing!</i><br><br>\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Gameplay Videos</strong><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br>\ud83c\udfe1 [Luxury Cars &amp; Real Estate]<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755670